,title,link,text,language,family
0,Bhilali language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhilali_language,"Bhilali is a Bhil language spoken in India. it has two main varieties: Bhilali proper and Rathawi (Rathwi), which are largely mutually intelligible. A third variety, Parya Bhilali, is more distant but is still considered a dialect of the language.",Rathawi,Indo-European
